/T (Mechatronics at Iowa is a new student organization at the University of Iowa, founded by a group of like-minded students with a passion for robotics. As an organization, we work together to create and develop robots to teach students about various engineering disciplines and develop their skill sets. We do this by competing against over 200+ other universities worldwide in the RoboMasters University League, as well as promoting outreach and education with various other local robotics teams and programs. )
/E (Mechatronics at Iowa is a new student organization at the University of Iowa, founded by a group of like-minded students with a passion for robotics. As an organization, we work together to create and develop robots to teach students about various engineering disciplines and develop their skill sets. We do this by competing against over 200+ other universities worldwide in the RoboMasters University League, as well as promoting outreach and education with various other local robotics teams and programs. )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [3]
